   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2 style=\"\n",
    "background: linear-gradient(90deg, #12304A, #167D9A);\n",
    "color: white;\n",
    "padding: 12px 18px;\n",
    "border-radius: 8px;\n",
    "font-size: 30px;\n",
    "\">\n",
    "01. Introduction\n",
    "</h2>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e861f4bb-0fb0-49c5-b44c-6caac7b31199",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<p style=\"font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.8;\">\n",
    "\n",
    "Electric Vehicle (EV) batteries are one of the most important\n",
    "components of electric vehicles. Over time, battery performance\n",
    "gradually decreases due to usage patterns, charging behaviour,\n",
    "temperature conditions, and battery aging.\n",
    "\n",
    "This project focuses on analyzing EV battery health data to\n",
    "understand battery degradation, identify factors affecting\n",
    "battery performance, examine failure risks, and study the\n",
    "remaining useful life of batteries.\n",
    "\n",
    "The analysis uses Python libraries such as Pandas, NumPy,\n",
    "Matplotlib, and Seaborn to perform data cleaning, exploratory\n",
    "data analysis, statistical analysis, and data visualization.\n",
    "The main objective is to generate meaningful insights into\n",
    "EV battery performance and health.\n",
    "</p>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1c3199d7-62c8-4612-8738-af3a66fcea41",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Dataset Description\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset contains information about EV battery performance,\n",
    "battery characteristics, charging behaviour, environmental\n",
    "conditions, battery health, and degradation indicators."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "59aa6540-64da-42c7-a7c6-739fc0025f15",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2 style=\"\n",
    "background: linear-gradient(90deg, #12304A, #167D9A);\n",
    "color: white;\n",
    "padding: 12px 18px;\n",
    "border-radius: 8px;\n",
    "font-size: 30px;\n",
    "\">\n",
    "02. Data Loading and Initial Inspection\n",
    "</h2>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9dd28d19-8e94-4eea-b5e3-eb8ce1ddf8ac",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "In this section, the EV battery health dataset is loaded into\n",
    "Python. The dataset structure, number of rows and columns,\n",
    "data types, and statistical information are examined to\n",
    "understand the data before performing data cleaning."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d59c9629-2d76-4744-aa94-88e100c64a6b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')"
   ]
  },
