   "source": [
    "## 11.6 Removing Duplicate Records\n",
    "\n",
    "Duplicate records can affect the accuracy of data analysis. In this step, completely duplicated rows will be removed from the dataset while preserving repeated battery IDs that may represent different observations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "a8850a2e-5e58-40d9-ad0b-9fe591b22341",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Remove completely duplicated rows\n",
    "\n",
    "df = df.drop_duplicates()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "id": "62bde61a-c75d-4402-80c4-a96229febb91",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "np.int64(0)"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 21,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
