   "source": [
    "## 11.19 Checking Date Columns\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset contains three important date columns: manufacture_date, observation_date, and last_service_date. In this step, we examine their date ranges and missing values to identify possible data quality issues."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 61,
   "id": "4213a562-c273-42b6-9981-93f89b8ffb29",
   "metadata": {},
