   "source": [
    "## 11.26 Temperature Difference Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "In this step, we calculate the difference between peak temperature during fast charging and average ambient temperature. This helps us identify records where peak temperature is lower than ambient temperature."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 75,
   "id": "650d71b8-98bd-4c8b-ada5-d5ec00938493",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "count    44713.000000\n",
       "mean         5.596874\n",
       "std          5.091581\n",
       "min        -43.036622\n",
       "25%          2.500000\n",
       "50%          5.100000\n",
       "75%          8.200000\n",
       "max         61.324838\n",
       "Name: temperature_difference, dtype: float64"
      ]
