   "source": [
    "## 11.46 Analysing Battery Temperature Difference\n",
    "\n",
    "In this step, we analyse the difference between average ambient temperature and peak fast-charging temperature to identify unusual temperature variations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 105,
   "id": "b853bc92-2167-4cc7-980a-2f1456b69ed7",
