   "source": [
    "### 11.59 Dataset Cleaning Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset cleaning process included:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Checked and removed duplicate records.\n",
    "2. Converted date columns into datetime format.\n",
    "3. Identified missing values in numerical and categorical columns.\n",
    "4. Handled numerical missing values using median imputation.\n",
    "5. Handled categorical missing values using mode imputation.\n",
    "6. Identified potential outliers using the IQR method.\n",
    "7. Checked invalid numerical values and date inconsistencies.\n",
    "8. Created new features such as temperature_difference and calculated_battery_age_days.\n",
    "9. Verified the final dataset structure and data types.\n",
    "\n",
    "The cleaned dataset contains 50,000 rows and 37 columns.\n",
    "Date-related missing values were retained because their actual values could not be reliably determined."
   ]
  },
